<title>PHILIPPINES: United Paragon supervisors to strike.</title>
<headline>United Paragon supervisors to strike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner United Paragon Mining Corp said on Wednesday its supervisors' union has served a strike notice.</p>
<p>United Paragon vice-president Pedro Oyam said in a statement that the strike notice was the result of a deadlock in talks over a wage increase.</p>
<p>Oyam told Reuters the strike by the union which has 76 members out of a total workforce of 1,000 employees &quot;will not materially affect the company's operations&quot;.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
